      "created_at": "2025-09-25T13:57:16.118Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/gdhelp03\">@gdhelp03</a></p>\n<p>The <strong>Kanban View</strong> of job card list may help along with <strong>assign to function</strong> will allow user to see only job cards assigned to him on any date or stage dynamically.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/8/b8688c1dd8956a25fb3fe9470722116cb1051672.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b8688c1dd8956a25fb3fe9470722116cb1051672\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/8/b8688c1dd8956a25fb3fe9470722116cb1051672_2_690x342.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"qjlQsJzStwBXk2xdG07kmGm9Z4K\" width=\"690\" height=\"342\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/8/b8688c1dd8956a25fb3fe9470722116cb1051672_2_690x342.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/8/b8688c1dd8956a25fb3fe9470722116cb1051672_2_1035x513.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/8/b8688c1dd8956a25fb3fe9470722116cb1051672_2_1380x684.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F5F4F4\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1871×930 85.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
