      "id": 482292,
      "username": "gdhelp03",
      "name": "Gagandeep",
      "created_at": "2025-09-27T04:15:15.751Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I checked again and noticed the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>When no employee is assigned to a Job Card, all employees who have permission for Job Card are able to update it.</li>\n<li>If a specific employee is assigned, then only that employee can update it. (So my second question is resolved.)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Now I have only one question related to Job Cards:<br>\nHow can I set a default employee for a particular Job Card?</p>\n<p>For example, for each operation there should be one or more users (or a group) assigned by default. A role-based assignment for operations would be more practical in this case.</p>",
